3d:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"is-there-a-fixed-taxi-price-from-riyadh-to-dammam","children":"Is there a fixed taxi price from Riyadh to Dammam?"}]
3e:["$","p","p-8",{"children":"The price is fixed once quoted, but there is no single published figure — it depends on the vehicle, addresses, date and stops. Send your details on WhatsApp and you receive one fixed fare before you book."}]
3f:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"is-the-train-cheaper-than-a-taxi","children":"Is the train cheaper than a taxi?"}]
40:["$","p","p-9",{"children":"For one traveller usually yes, because the train sells per-person tickets. For a group sharing one car the comparison can reverse. Check current SAR fares and compare them with a fixed car quote."}]
